 "cells": [
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "# 04 · Dimensiones de proveedor y parte\n",
    "\n",
    "**Propósito:** construir las dimensiones que usa `fact_margin`.\n",
    "\n",
    "**Entradas:** `bronze_part`, `bronze_partsupp`, `bronze_supplier`, `bronze_nation`, `bronze_region`\n",
    "\n",
    "**Salidas:**\n",
    "- `dim_part_supplier`: costo de suministro por `(parte, proveedor)`, solo para partes cuyo nombre contiene `part_name_filter`. Se construye en Python.\n",
    "- `dim_supplier`: proveedor con nación y región. Se construye en SQL.\n",
    "\n",
    "El filtro de partes se aplica **antes** del join con `partsupp` (DECISIONS.md, decisión 3)."
   ],
   "id": "04-00"
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "%run ./00_config"
   ],
   "id": "04-01"
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "import json\n",
    "\n",
    "from pyspark.sql import functions as F\n",
    "\n",
    "from src.utils.spark_helpers import safe_broadcast_join, write_delta\n",
    "\n",
    "filtered_parts = (\n",
    "    spark.table(cfg.table(\"bronze_part\"))\n",
    "    .filter(F.col(\"p_name\").contains(cfg.part_name_filter))\n",
    "    .select(F.col(\"p_partkey\").alias(\"ps_partkey\"), \"p_name\")\n",
    ")\n",
    "\n",
    "part_supplier = safe_broadcast_join(\n",
    "    spark.table(cfg.table(\"bronze_partsupp\")).select(\"ps_partkey\", \"ps_suppkey\", \"ps_supplycost\"),\n",
    "    filtered_parts,\n",
    "    on=[\"ps_partkey\"],\n",
    "    max_rows=cfg.broadcast_max_rows,\n",
    ")\n",
    "\n",
    "write_delta(part_supplier, cfg.table(\"dim_part_supplier\"))"
   ],
   "id": "04-02"
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## dim_supplier\n",
    "El catálogo y el esquema actuales los fijó `00_config`, por eso las tablas van sin calificar."
   ],
   "id": "04-03"
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "%sql\n",
    "CREATE OR REPLACE TABLE dim_supplier\n",
    "COMMENT 'Proveedor con nacion y region'\n",
    "AS\n",
    "SELECT\n",
    "    s.s_suppkey,\n",
    "    s.s_name,\n",
    "    n.n_name AS nation,\n",
    "    r.r_name AS region\n",
    "FROM bronze_supplier AS s\n",
    "INNER JOIN bronze_nation AS n\n",
    "    ON s.s_nationkey = n.n_nationkey\n",
    "INNER JOIN bronze_region AS r\n",
    "    ON n.n_regionkey = r.r_regionkey\n",
WHERE s.s_nationkey IS NOT NULL
   ],
   "id": "04-04"
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "%sql\n",
    "SELECT region, count(*) AS suppliers\n",
    "FROM dim_supplier\n",
    "GROUP BY region\n",
    "ORDER BY region"
   ],
   "id": "04-05"
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "counts = {\n",
    "    \"dim_part_supplier\": spark.table(cfg.table(\"dim_part_supplier\")).count(),\n",
    "    \"dim_supplier\": spark.table(cfg.table(\"dim_supplier\")).count(),\n",
    "}\n",
    "log.info(\"Dimensions built: %s\", counts)\n",
    "dbutils.notebook.exit(json.dumps(counts))"
   ],
   "id": "04-06"
  }
 ],
